Task
Command
Initialize Git
git init
Check file changes
git status
Stage all changes
git add .
Commit changes
git commit -m "Add data analysis"
Create a branch
git branch feature-analysis
Switch branches
git switch feature-analysis
View commit history
git log --oneline
Connect to GitHub
git remote add origin <URL>
Push to GitHub
git push -u origin main
Get latest changes
